    {
      "paper_id": "doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2023.01.023",
      "sequence": 3,
      "source_sequence": 15,
      "article_type": "research-article",
      "title_en": "Reprint of: Formulation and estimation of stochastic frontier production function models",
      "title_cn": "重印：随机前沿生产函数模型的设定与估计",
      "authors": [
        "Dennis Aigner",
        "C.A. Knox Lovell",
        "Peter Schmidt"
      ],
      "abstract_en": "Previous studies of the so-called frontier production function have not utilized an adequate characterization of the disturbance term for such a model. In this paper we provide an appropriate specification, by defining the disturbance term as the sum of symmetric normal and (negative) half-normal random variables. Various aspects of maximum-likelihood estimation for the coefficients of a production function with an additive disturbance term of this sort are then considered.",
      "abstract_cn": "以往关于所谓前沿生产函数的研究并未对此类模型的扰动项进行充分刻画。本文通过将扰动项定义为对称正态随机变量与（负）半正态随机变量之和，提供了适当的设定。随后，我们考虑了具有此类加性扰动项的生产函数系数极大似然估计的各个方面。",
